              <span class="dot green"></span>
              <span class="proof-url">https://cloud.deepdoc.tech/pranav322/codewiki</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image-wrap">
              {/* ponytail: both theme variants are fetched even though CSS hides one
                  — display:none doesn't cancel an <img> download. Kept because the
